Package: gtfsanalyzer
Type: Package
Title: Validate and Analyse 'GTFS' Schedule Feeds with 'GTFS Analyzer'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tacettin", "Tezer", email = "ttezer@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An interface to the 'GTFS Analyzer' command line validator
    <https://github.com/ttezer/gtfs-analyzer> for 'GTFS' (General Transit Feed
    Specification) Schedule feeds. Runs the validator on a feed archive and
    returns publishability, quality scores and findings as R objects, and
    compares two versions of a feed. The validator is a standalone executable;
    it can be installed into the user cache directory with a checksum-verified
    download, or an existing executable can be used.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ttezer/gtfs-analyzer
BugReports: https://github.com/ttezer/gtfs-analyzer/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    openssl,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
